Package: priceDiscoveRy
Title: Information Share Estimation for Financial Markets with Partially Overlapping Trading Hours
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Hui", "Sun", , "sophia8226@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates daily contribution-weighted information shares (CWIS)
    for a futures and spot pair observed over a 24-hour trading day. The
    package separates overlapping and non-overlapping sessions, estimates a
    vector error-correction model in overlapping sessions, estimates realized
    kernels in single-market sessions, and aggregates daily results.
